  "description": "The meme trivializes a tragic real-world event — a fatal car accident in Mexico that resulted in 93 deaths — by juxtaposing it with a mocking, unimpressed facial expression (actor Mike Myers). This reduces human suffering to a joke, potentially desensitizing viewers and disrespecting victims and their families. The harmful intent stems from the cultural understanding that mocking tragedies is inappropriate and emotionally damaging.",
